  "_why_kept_verbatim": "Four kinds of thing, none of them prose: pure punctuation and hearts used as stage punctuation (!!, ??, ♥ ♥); a speaker tag followed by punctuation ([mc]!!, [k]?); a key name or page-turn shortcut (a, q, {#auto_page}A, {#quick_page}Q, transition); and proper names that stay in their own script -- the typeface names DejaVu Sans and Opendyslexic, the loanword Cosplay, and the product name 'Academy: Live!', which is config.name and so renames the game itself if translated."
